name: fraud_roaming
title: "Roaming high usage runbook"
summary: "Detects: roaming charge per subscriber in the window, above `threshold` (default 500)."
steps[4]:
  - text: "Detects: roaming charge per subscriber in the window, above `threshold` (default 500)."
    link:
      kind: dataset
      id: fraud_roaming
  - text: "Check: the visited network, and whether the usage fits the subscriber's history and credit limit."
  - text: "Act: apply the roaming spending cap; contact the subscriber."
  - text: "Known false-positive source (no defence here): a business traveller whose legitimate spend passes the threshold. The pack has no subscriber tier to tell them apart."
ownerRole: fraud-analyst
tags[2]: fraud, telco
